VALIDATION REPORT  FRM  Fernhill rating model
====================================================================
Date 6 February 2026; data to 31 December 2025; by model validation
(second line).

Scope
  - reproduction of the grades from the documented inputs
  - ranking and the analysts' holds of its grades

Confirmed
  - its grades rank defaults well (Gini 0.857)

Findings
  FRM-1 (high, blocks use, section 23.7)
    The model cannot be reproduced: from leverage, cover and size
    its grade is matched only two times in three.
    Action: Replace it with the Ballast rating model at the 2026
            reviews, after RATE's conditions are met.
  FRM-2 (high, section 23.7)
    Analysts held 195 grades the model wanted worse; held clients
    defaulted at 4.1% on a grade PD of 1.47%. No hold has a reason
    on file.
    Action: Every override recorded with its reasons and approved by
            the credit function.

Conclusion: NOT APPROVED
